text","text":"enlarged state; the switch state feeds a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard."}],"title":"Interaction_PinchView"}}}